id: pm-8l1m5t
title: Refresh compatible 2026-08-08 development dependencies
description: "Update the compatible @types/node and ESLint patch releases found by the 2026-08-08 live dependency sweep. Keep npm-package-arg 14 and TypeScript 7 deferred under their existing compatibility owners; verify the complete quality, coverage, security, and packed-consumer gates."
type: Chore
status: closed
priority: 2
tags[3]: code-quality,dependencies,security
created_at: "2026-08-08T09:58:16.116Z"
updated_at: "2026-08-11T02:02:31.404Z"
closed_at: "2026-08-11T02:02:30.824Z"
completed_at: "2026-08-11T02:02:30.824Z"
author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 45
acceptance_criteria: @types/node and ESLint resolve to their current compatible releases; pnpm audit and GitHub dependency/secret/code scanning are triaged; Node typecheck lint full 100/100/100/100 coverage and packed npx/bunx consumers pass; incompatible majors remain linked to canonical open items without duplicate work
resolution: fixed
expected_result: Compatible aged development dependency patches land without policy bypasses or security and consumer regressions.
actual_result: "ESLint 10.8.1 and Node types 26.2.0 are locked; audit and GitHub alerts are clean, while incompatible or too-new updates remain on canonical deferred lineages."
